<h1>Homegrown Restaurant Menu Pricing Database</h1>
<p>
    Group 41 &mdash; The Data Foragers (Anton Choo and Borislava Grigorova).
    This web app manages the menu items, ingredients, and vendors that drive
    Homegrown's menu pricing.
</p>

<section>
