<section>
    <h2>RESET Database</h2>
    <p>
        The red <strong>RESET Database</strong> button in the navigation bar
        restores every table to its original sample data by calling the
        <code>sp_reset_foodmenudb()</code> stored procedure (PL.SQL), which
        rebuilds the schema via <code>sp_load_foodmenudb()</code> (DDL.sql).
        Feel free to add, update, and delete anything &mdash; one click brings
        the database back to its starting state.
    </p>
</section>
